WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,710
I thought you were going to take me to a new coffee shop, that's it

2
00:00:02,710 --> 00:00:03,910
Dare to sell a bottle for thirty yuan

3
00:00:03,910 --> 00:00:05,110
You can buy six bottles of Fei Chao

4
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:06,310
This price is crazy when you think about it.

5
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:07,510
But don't say it yet

6
00:00:07,510 --> 00:00:09,110
I've never heard of this brand.

7
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:10,310
Just buy it and you're done

8
00:00:10,310 --> 00:00:11,510
If you drink it, it won’t work

9
00:00:11,510 --> 00:00:12,510
Just treat me as a treat

10
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:16,060
You can buy with confidence

11
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:18,660
Super coffee was originally supplied internally by a listed group

12
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:19,660
No external bribery

13
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:21,060
I have a relationship with my boss

14
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,060
Only then can I get some goods

15
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,060
And the whole Jiangcheng

16
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,060
I'm the only one who sells it

17
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:27,600
This is the only family in the whole Jiangcheng

18
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,800
As soon as the boss with my surname comes back, I will have a bottle too.

19
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,000
After you take it, hurry up and check out.

20
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,600
Don't squeeze in here. I still want to take it.
